(S, "A boy walks 10 miles north, turns back and walks 10 miles, then turns right and again turns right. Which direction is he facing now?", ["North", "South", "East", "West"], 0, "After turning back he walks south and faces south. Turning right from south he faces west, and turning right again he faces north.", "A right turn is a 90 degree clockwise turn.", [1613]),
(S, "Against whom did the Muslims fight the Battle of Badr?", ["Jews of Khaybar", "Quraish of Makkah", "Romans", "Persians"], 1, "The Battle of Badr in 2 AH was fought between the Muslims and the Quraish of Makkah.", "It was the first major battle of Islam.", [757, 5486]),
(S, "In which city of Pakistan is Liaquat Bagh located?", ["Lahore", "Karachi", "Rawalpindi", "Peshawar"], 2, "Liaquat Bagh is a park in Rawalpindi where Liaquat Ali Khan was assassinated in 1951.", "It is also known for the 2007 assassination of Benazir Bhutto nearby.", [2543]),
