(S, "Ali and Ahmed have 25 balls in all. If Ali has 4 times as many as Ahmed, how many balls does Ahmed have?", ["4", "5", "6", "8"], 1, "Let Ahmed have x. Then x + 4x = 25, so 5x = 25 and x = 5.", "Ali then has 20 balls.", [763]),
